The StillPoint Saga — Licensing
================================

This repository contains three different kinds of work, released under three
different licenses. When in doubt about a specific file, the most specific
license notice in or near that file governs.

1. The creative work — All Rights Reserved
-------------------------------------------
The novel, the short stories, the fan fiction, and the fictional world bible —
everything under `novel/`, `short_stories/`, `fan_fiction/`, and `world/` —
are copyright © 2025–2026 Wally Kroeker. All rights reserved.

These works are published here for reading and reference. They may not be
reproduced, distributed, adapted, or used for AI training without permission.

2. Movement & practice materials — CC BY-SA 4.0
-----------------------------------------------
Materials about the StillPoint *practice* and the "third way" movement —
guides, frameworks, and shared resources meant to be adopted and adapted by
others — are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
International License (CC BY-SA 4.0). See `LICENSE-CC-BY-SA`.

This is a deliberately forward-looking tier: as practice materials are written
they will be published under this license, either grouped under a `practice/`
path or marked inline. It does not extend to the creative work in section 1.

3. The platform code — MIT
--------------------------
The website and the tooling that publishes it — `astro-dev-site/` and
`scripts/` — are released under the MIT License. See `LICENSE-MIT`.

---

The licensing intent: keep the story as the author's own creative work, let the
ideas and practices be a commons others can build on, and let the code be freely
reusable. The split trends open over time.

Questions: open an issue, or reach the author via https://stillpointproject.org
